      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Isostructural {Gd3Ni3} cluster with overall antiferromagnetic coupling. χMT at 300 K is 27.55 cm3·K·mol−1 (1.0 kOe) and decreases to 16.38 cm3·K·mol−1 at 2.0 K. MAGPACK 3J fit: J1(Gd···Gd) = −0.04 cm−1, J2(Gd···Ni, threefold oximato) = −0.48 cm−1, J3(Gd···Ni, single oximato) = −0.08 cm−1, g = 2.24. Magnetization at 2.0 K and 70 kOe is 27.95 Nβ, near the 27.00 Nβ saturation value. Significant cryogenic magnetocaloric effect: −ΔSm reaches 24.78 J·kg−1·K−1 at 3.0 K and 70 kOe (abstract/table also quote 24.8 J·kg−1·K−1).",
